'''Thelsamar''' is a [[Dwarf|dwarven]] town on the west side of [[Loch Modan]], located north of [[Grizzlepaw Ridge]] and northeast of [[Stonesplinter Valley]]. The town has a [[gryphon]] roost, an [[Stoutlager Inn|inn]], and several vendors and profession trainers. A north-south road runs just west of town, leading to the passes into [[Dun Morogh]] and the [[Wetlands]].

